  "headline": "One Piece live-action Season 2 trailer adds new character and location reveals",
  "description": "Anime News Network reported on 2026-02-10 that the One Piece live-action Season 2 trailer introduced additional character and location details.",
  "articleBody": "Anime News Network reported on 2026-02-10 that a new trailer for One Piece live-action Season 2 was released, highlighting additional characters and locations.\n\nAt this point, confirmed details are limited to what appears in the trailer and what is explicitly described in the cited report. Exact rollout timing and full episode structure remain unconfirmed unless announced through official channels.\n\nFor follow-up tracking, pairing trade coverage with official account updates is useful to separate sourced facts from interpretation.\n\n- Sources:\n  - https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-02-10/live-action-one-piece-series-season-2-trailer-previews-new-characters-locations/.233997\n  - https://x.com/Eiichiro_Staff",
